        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 29:5",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 29,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Now, seeing that I know these things, why should I desire more than to perform the work to which I have been called?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 78,
            "text": "TG Stewardship."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Stewardship.",
            "prettyString": "TG Stewardship",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Stewardship",
                "entryId": "tg-stewardship",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 29:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 29,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Why should I desire that I were an angel, that I could speak unto all the ends of the earth?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 29:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 29,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "For behold, the Lord doth grant unto all nations, of their own nation and tongue, to teach his word, yea, in wisdom, all that he seeth fit that they should have; therefore we see that the Lord doth counsel in wisdom, according to that which is just and true.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "3 Ne. 26:8 (7–10); D&C 11:22."
          },
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "2 Ne. 2:27; 29:12."
          },
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "D&C 90:11."
          },
          {
            "start": 129,
            "end": 134,
            "text": "Alma 12:9 (9–11)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
